The jar bundles prebuilt qpdf runtime libraries (libqpdf and companion
libraries) for windows-x86/x86_64/aarch64, linux-x86_64/aarch64, and
macos-x86_64/aarch64, downloaded from the official qpdf GitHub releases and
verified against their published SHA-256 checksums. The full copyright and
license notice of the bundled version is available at runtime via
Jqpdf.qpdfCopyright().
